   "source": [
    "# 5. FEATURE ENGINEERING\n",
    "The raw dataset separates every metric into fine-grained components (e.g. onsite vs offsite ATMs, POS vs online vs other transaction channels). These are combined into single \"total\" measures total ATM/CRM network, total QR infrastructure, total cards, total credit-card and debit-card payment volume value, and total cash withdrawal volume/value, because the business questions in this project (overall infrastructure scale, overall card adoption, overall transaction activity) concern the whole picture, not individual channels. Building these totals once avoids repeating the same addition inside every later chart. year, month and month_name are also extracted from date using pandas' .dt accessor so the data can be grouped by calendar period for the time-series analysis in Section 7."
   ]
